flowchart TD
    T[Pin task and workload contract] --> G[Generate and record candidate]
    G --> C[Shared behavioral checks]
    C -->|Pass| W[Select and measure workloads]
    C -->|Fail| R[Record rejection and feedback]
    W --> D[Apply declared acceptance requirements]
    D --> F[Fresh confirmation or defer]
    F --> H[Record decision and parent history]
    H -->|Budget remains| G
    R -->|Budget remains| G
    H --> O[Freeze final delivered patch]
    O --> A[Independent audit and analysis]
